        <CoiStatement>There are no conflicts of interest. What is new? In rare circumstances, FGD may respond incompletely to 15 mg/m2/day dose. Under strict monitoring, dose of oral corticoids may be increased upto 20 mg/m2/day. Although systemic problems improved completely, mucocutaneous pigmentation may respond partially even at this dose.</CoiStatement>
